# Environment variable template
#
# RULES
# - Placeholders only. Never commit real credentials, tokens, or keys.
# - Every value here must also appear in the environment-config specification with
#   its purpose, an example value, and a security note.
# - Values marked SECRET must never be printed in logs or error messages.

# APP_ENV=development

# Data store. SQLite while it is one person's; DATABASE_URL is used on Postgres.
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:password@localhost:5432/pantry   # SECRET

# Where private dish photos are stored (local path or object-store bucket).
# PHOTO_STORAGE_DIR=./uploads

# Authentication secret depends on the chosen auth model (Q-006) — for example a
# session-signing key. Add it here once the auth model is decided.
# SESSION_SECRET=changeme   # SECRET

# Blueprint: blueprints/env-example.md
